<title>JAPAN: Fukoku Mutual says bad loans nearly manageable.</title>
<headline>Fukoku Mutual says bad loans nearly manageable.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fukoku Mutual Life Insurance Co said on Thursday that its bad loans had almost been reduced to a manageable level by the end of September.</p>
<p>A company official also said the insurer's loan loss reserves had been raised to 50 percent of its bad loans.</p>
</text>
